{"title": "Fiendish Ascension", "pageid": 25957, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fiendish_Ascension", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fiendish_Ascension.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Fiendish_Ascension.webp/300px-Fiendish_Ascension.webp, /w/images/3/3c/Fiendish_Ascension.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Fiendish_Ascension.webp/300px-Fiendish_Ascension.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Fiendish_Ascension.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Fiendish Ascension</b> is a free action available to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> that lets him take his infernal form after a Soul Pillar has been destroyed. He can use this action once per destroy Soul Pillar.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Harness the energy of a recently shattered Soul Pillar to take on a more powerful infernal form, and consume a new soul for every broken pillar.\n</p>\nEach time Raphael transforms he may stay in this heightened aspect for longer.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Four times per battle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Four times per battle</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version usable after one soul pillar is destroyed</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_2</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version usable after two soul pillars are destroyed</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_3</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version usable after three soul pillars are destroyed</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_4</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_Raphael_Transform_4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version usable after all soul pillars are destroyed</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ascended_Fiend\"> Condition: Ascended Fiend </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascended Fiend\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">Ascended Fiend</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Raphael has gorged on souls and enhanced his fiendish powers, granting him an even deadlier array of spells and abilities. In this form, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Overcharge_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Overcharge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Overcharge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Overcharge_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Overcharge (Condition)\">Soul Overcharge</a> will not prevent him from using Souls to cast spells.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Raphael has four versions of this ability with escalating potency.\n<ul><li>After one soul pillar is destroyed, he transforms into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascended Fiend\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">Ascended Fiend</a> for 1 turn.</li>\n<li>After two soul pillars are destroyed, he transforms into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascended Fiend\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">Ascended Fiend</a> for 2 turns.</li>\n<li>After three soul pillar are destroyed, he transforms into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascended Fiend\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">Ascended Fiend</a> for 3 turns.</li>\n<li>After all soul pillars are destroyed, he transforms into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascended Fiend\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">Ascended Fiend</a> permanently. Additionally, Raphael becomes enraged, changing his AI to only use melee attacks.</li></ul></li>\n<li>These versions do not need to be used in order. Raphael will skip to using the strongest one available to him.</li>\n<li>The in-game tooltip says this ability is once per battle, but this is misleading since each of the four copies can be used once per battle.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045436\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3588/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49091/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19357/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1354198/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   76.897      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   76.897      1 -total\n 85.52%   65.765     47 Template:Trim\n 23.55%   18.108      4 Template:SmCond\n 22.00%   16.914      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 21.11%   16.234      7 Template:Icon_text\n 20.09%   15.451      6 Template:Icon_link\n 11.78%    9.060      1 Template:CharLink\n 11.34%    8.717      7 Template:Ifempty\n 11.01%    8.468      7 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:25957-0!canon